L66: Written informed consent was obtained from each player and study protocol conformed to the ethical guidelines of the Declaration of Helsinki. Ethical clearance (Ref No. IHEC/AB/P82/2019) was obtained from the Institutional Human Ethical Committee (IHEC), Department of Physiology, University of Calcutta.
